  "details": "I log on vr chat and the controls are going crazy doing multiple inputs at once without me touching anything. My character is doing circles, jumping, safety mode is turning on and off, its toggling on and off my mic and it keeps pulling up the quick menu's on both hands. This happens on desktop mode and vr mode. I've restarted the game, uninstallled, and even tried unplugging my keyboard and taking the batteries out my quest controllers and but it still continued. It started a little after my quest warned me that it was low on battery.",
